  "notes": "USAGE: {引算|ひきざん} (also written as {引|ひ}き{算|ざん}) is the elementary math term for subtraction.\n\nBASIC ARITHMETIC OPERATIONS:\n- {足算|たしざん} (addition)\n- {引算|ひきざん} (subtraction)\n- {掛算|かけざん} (multiplication)\n- {割算|わりざん} (division)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {引算|ひきざん}をする (to do subtraction)\n- XからYを{引算|ひきざん}する (to subtract Y from X)\n\nNOTE: While {引算|ひきざん} is the noun form, the verb {引|ひ}く is commonly used: 10から3を{引|ひ}く = 10 - 3.",
